                             speaks.)**\\n\\n\\u201cLog entry\\u2026            
                             supplemental.  It\\u2019s\\u2026                   
                             difficult to articulate this, even to a            
                             machine.  For years, I dedicated myself            
                             to *saving* lives.  Eradicating                    
                             disease, improving crop yields\\u2026              
