                             They\'re Band-Aids on a gaping wound.              
                             Education initiatives take generations.            
                             Economic development\\u2026 well, the              
                             wealth isn\\u2019t trickling down fast             
                             enough, is it?  And frankly, even with             
                             massive investment, can the planet                 
                             truly support the numbers we\'re                   
                             anticipating?\\n\\nI\\u2019ve spent the            
                             last\\u2026 too many months\\u2026                 
                             researching retroviruses.                          
                             Specifically, ones that could be                   
                             engineered to induce temporary,                    
                             reversible infertility.  Not sterility.            
